{"unit_id":"shaokeyibb__dsh-plugin-product-subagents#card-zh","repo":"shaokeyibb/dsh-plugin-product-subagents","commit":"9b5017f323c92fef3a6af149e978e94b14c458ea","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-product-subagents 为 DeepSeek Harness Web profile 接入 Codex、Claude Code 和 ACP 子代理。它注册委派、角色目录、子代理提交、等待、进度与可用性工具，支持同步任务和可续接子代理。角色可设置远端权限及是否允许继续委派；子代理固定使用同一产品会话，并可从持久记录恢复。还可配置自定义 ACP CLI、并发数和空闲回收时间，适合拆分编码、审查、探索与排错工作。需要 Node.js 18+ 和一个已安装、已认证且位于 PATH 的产品 CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-17","lib/index.js:178-183","lib/tools/product-delegate.js:22-39","lib/tools/product-submit.js:32-59","lib/registry.js:1-35"]}
